## 🎨 DESIGN SPECIFICATIONS

### Color Scheme (Modern & Professional)
- **Primary:** Deep Blue (#1e40af) - Trust, intelligence
- **Secondary:** Emerald Green (#10b981) - Success, growth
- **Accent:** Purple (#8b5cf6) - Innovation, creativity
- **Neutral:** Slate Gray (#64748b) - Text, backgrounds
- **Background:** White (#ffffff) with light gray (#f8fafc) alternating sections

### Typography
- **Headings:** Inter or Poppins (Bold, Modern Sans-serif)
- **Body:** Inter or System UI (Clean, readable)
- **Code/Tech:** JetBrains Mono (for tech stack section)

### Visual Elements
- **Icons:** Lucide or Heroicons (consistent, modern)
- **Illustrations:** Undraw.co style or custom SVG illustrations
- **Images:** High-quality photos of diverse students and teachers
- **Animations:** Subtle fade-ins, smooth scrolling, hover effects

### Layout & Spacing
- **Container:** Max-width 1200px, centered
- **Sections:** 80-120px vertical padding
- **Cards:** Shadow-sm, rounded-lg borders
- **Buttons:** Large touch targets (48px min height), rounded

---

## 📱 RESPONSIVE DESIGN

### Desktop (1200px+)
- Full navigation bar
- Multi-column layouts (features grid: 3x2)
- Large hero images
- Side-by-side content

### Tablet (768px - 1199px)
- Condensed navigation
- 2-column grids
- Stacked sections where appropriate

### Mobile (<768px)
- Hamburger menu
- Single column layout
- Simplified features (vertical stack)
- Larger touch targets

---

## ⚡ TECHNICAL IMPLEMENTATION

### Stack for GitHub Pages
- **Framework:** Plain HTML/CSS/JS or React (with build to static)
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS via CDN or compiled
- **Animations:** AOS (Animate on Scroll) or Framer Motion
- **Icons:** Lucide Icons CDN
- **Hosting:** GitHub Pages (static site)

### File Structure
```
docs/
├── index.html
├── css/
│   └── styles.css
├── js/
│   └── main.js
├── images/
│   ├── hero.svg
│   ├── features/
│   └── logos/
└── README.md
```

### Key Features to Implement
- ✅ Smooth scroll navigation
- ✅ Intersection Observer for animations
- ✅ Mobile-responsive hamburger menu
- ✅ Form validation for demo requests
- ✅ Fast loading (<2s LCP)
- ✅ SEO optimized meta tags
- ✅ Accessible (WCAG AA)

